meta {
  name: Fax faxesSend
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v2.2/faxes
  body: multipart-form
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Idempotency-Key: 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
}

body:multipart-form {
  fromNumber: 2015550123
  toNumber: 2125550123
  @documents: ./document.pdf
}

docs {
**Send a fax**
Submits a fax for delivery. The multipart form carries fromNumber, toNumber and one to ten documents (PDF, DOC or DOCX, checked by content; 8 MiB each and in total). Idempotency-Key is a client-generated UUID: resubmitting the same documents with the same key returns the original job instead of sending again. Requires an enabled account with a positive balance; rate-limited to 10 sends per minute per account.

OperationId: `faxesSend`
}
